| To install to HD:
| 1. Copy !Chuck to HD
| 2. Open !Chuck via Shift-Double left click
| 3. Copy CHUCK from disc 2 into !Chuck
| 4. Replace the contents of !Chuck.!Run with:
|  ADFBootFloppy F1008101
IF "<Obey$Dir>"="@" THEN ADFReserveMemory 800K
IF "<Obey$Dir>"="@" THEN Set Obey$Dir ADFS::0.$.!Chuck
StoreCSD
DIR <Obey$Dir>

Set Chuck$Dir <Obey$dir>
ADFWimpSlot 464k
| Archimedes Live: use the game's own MusicModule, not ADFFS's MusMod2 on QTM.
| QTM's sound interrupt keeps IRQs off for up to ~1 ms, which can delay the
| game's timer 1 palette changes
RMEnsure MusicModule2 0 RMLoad <Chuck$Dir>.MUSMOD2
IF ADFFS$OSVersion>=&35000 THEN ADFRemapVideoMemory 9 160 ELSE ScreenSize 160
Echo <22><9>
Set JSflag 0
RMEnsure Joystick 0.0 Set JSflag 1
IF ADFFS$OSVersion<&50000 AND JSflag=1 THEN RMLoad ADFFS:extras.JoyMod
IF JSflag=0 THEN <Chuck$Dir>.JSTest

LOAD <Chuck$Dir>.ChuckProg
ADFCRC 8000 B1E4 384A2AF7 ChuckProg
| Correct JoyMod Joystick code in intro
MEMA 9EC8 EF0EFFC2 722000FF >B1B8 EF000011
IF ADFFS$CPUID>=&A10 THEN GOARM3JIT 8000 ELSE GO 8000
LOAD <Chuck$Dir>.GAME
ADFCRC 8000 25928 7B553C55 GAME
| Correct JoyMod Joystick code in game
MEMA 8418 EF0EFFC2 722000FF
GO 8000
MusSampleRate 2
FX 19
FX 19
IF "<Chuck$Dir>"="ADFS::0.$.!Chuck" THEN ADFReserveMemory 0
Unset Chuck$Dir
IF ADFFS$OSVersion>=&35000 THEN GOARM3JIT
IF ADFFS$OSVersion>=&35000 THEN ADFRemapVideoMemory
IF JSflag>0 THEN RMEnsure Joystick 0.0 Set JSflag 0
IF JSflag>0 THEN RMKill Joystick
Unset JSflag
RMKill MusicModule2
RestoreCSD
